From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 11:12:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 09/11] MERGE-8b5a91b5 (web): laptop packages 3..59 web files
 applied (GitLab main db6736c5..8b5a91b5)

Same cumulative pass as the C++ commit MERGE-8b5a91b5 (rules of the packages' check_and_copy.ps1). 51 web files changed:
NEW / OLD copied from the last package that carries them; two LOCAL files three-way merged, both clean:
- page/ht9045_recipe_client.js (base 2387ea0): the machine's TAKEOVER kept (takeover(), motorAccess auto ? acquire : takeover,
  every operator action takes over) + the laptop's TOKEN-IDLE (30 s idle release, hold functions, one re-acquire+resend on
  not-operator except motor.access) and RECIPE-BCB-R13 comment. One addition after the merge: takeover() now also arms the
  idle timer, as the laptop's acquire() does (same line).
- page/ht9045_io_do.js (base a5454b9): merged == machine (the laptop's change was already here).
With the C++ TOKEN-OFF (W906_WEB_TOKEN_ENFORCE 0) the server refuses nobody, so the page-side token code has nothing to wait on.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
